-- Q14393: Nontaxable Dispositions [medium/L3]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 1033 and established case law, severance damages compensate for the decline in value of retained property and reduce its basis rather than being recognized as immediate gain. The $50,000 severance damages reduce the retained 7-acre parcel''s basis from $350,000 to $300,000.
