  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under Treas. Reg. Section 1.409A-1(h), a separation from service occurs when the employee''s service level is reasonably anticipated to permanently decrease to 20% or less of the average level over the prior 36-month period. Dr. Ramos''s reduction from 40 to 12 hours (30%) does not meet the threshold, illustrating the quantitative standard.
